### Tested versions

- Reproducible in Godot 4.7.1 stable.
- Not runtime-tested with 4.7.2 or current `master`, but the relevant locking is unchanged.

### System information

Android 10 x86\_64 emulator, 1 vCPU, 2048 MiB RAM - Godot 4.7.1 - Vulkan Forward Mobile — llvmpipe.

### Issue description

Forward Mobile hangs when the following occurs:
1. The main/render thread calls ShaderData::is_valid() and locks singleton_mutex.

```cpp
bool SceneShaderForwardMobile::ShaderData::is_valid() const {
    if (version.is_valid()) {
        MutexLock lock(SceneShaderForwardMobile::singleton_mutex);
        // ...
        return SceneShaderForwardMobile::singleton->shader.version_is_valid(version);
    }
    return false;
}
```

2. version_is_valid() waits for shader compilation to finish without releasing singleton_mutex.

```cpp
bool ShaderRD::version_is_valid(RID p_version) {
    // ...
    _compile_ensure_finished(version);
    return version->valid;
}

void ShaderRD::_compile_version_end(Version *p_version, int p_group) {
    // ...
    WorkerThreadPool::get_singleton()->wait_for_group_task_completion(group_task);
}
```

3. The only worker is already compiling a graphics pipeline. It calls get_shader_variant() and waits for the same singleton_mutex.

```cpp
RID SceneShaderForwardMobile::ShaderData::get_shader_variant(...) const {
    if (version.is_valid()) {
        MutexLock lock(SceneShaderForwardMobile::singleton_mutex);
        // ...
        return SceneShaderForwardMobile::singleton->shader.version_get_shader(...);
    }
    return RID();
}
```

4. The main thread cannot release the mutex until shader compilation finishes. The only worker cannot finish its pipeline task until the mutex is released. The queued shader compilation therefore never runs.

This appears to be the Forward Mobile version of [#102877](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102877). [Commit 09282c3](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/09282c316a77c0e5beda9610e6a87f133ace5e94)  reduced these lock scopes in Forward Clustered, but Forward Mobile was not updated.

### Steps to reproduce

load a model that causes multiple shaders to get compiled and restrict the number of worker threads to 1.

### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)

Reproduction demonstrated through github actions at https://github.com/mickvangelderen/godot-123060
